WEBVTT

00:00:28.289 --> 00:00:32.096
about your experiences can be the key

00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:34.431
to driving your career success.

00:00:34.455 --> 00:00:36.385
[The Way We Work]

00:00:37.482 --> 00:00:39.505
[Made possible with
the support of Dropbox]

00:00:39.529 --> 00:00:43.086
Most of us experience self-doubt
at high-stakes moments,

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:45.116
especially if they're people of color,

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:46.796
first generation college student,

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:49.146
or they don't have
a traditional background,

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:50.756
so they don't fit "the mold."

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:53.410
If that's you, you're
a part of my community.

00:00:53.434 --> 00:00:56.022
What I've realized is
that these experiences

00:00:56.046 --> 00:00:57.986
that seem like a liability

00:00:58.010 --> 00:01:01.176
are actually your
differentiating strength.